  "description": "A-601 shows paint at the architect's 50% CD and stain at 100% CD, and the change story chg-1 is recorded, open and awaiting review. The 75% CD set, published on 9 June between the two, is entered late and already shows stain, so the 100% CD revision changes no property. In one operation maintenance records the reconstructed reconciliation chg-1/r1 with an empty @transitions and the related change story chg-1+1 (paint to stain at 75% CD); it revises chg-1's begin act to null (chg-1/v1) and records one baseline end act, cause reconstructed, whose record is the backfilled 75% CD Assertion and whose at is null; and it records chg-1+1's begin act. chg-1 has no period: it reads ended at every cutoff with the empty interval and no ending time, reports no transition and takes them from the reconciliation. chg-1+1 is open and awaiting review from 9 June, succeeds chg-1, and is the only story that open stories, pending review and what remains list, even at the cutoff at which chg-1 was first listed.",
